1
00:01:55,886 --> 00:02:03,986
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:04,233 --> 00:02:07,730
No living creature were hurt during the
production of this show.

3
00:02:08,730 --> 00:02:12,220
2 Days Later

4
00:02:16,585 --> 00:02:19,127
Togay is Noyan's son, my Bey.

5
00:02:19,127 --> 00:02:21,187
Noyan ha?

6
00:02:21,344 --> 00:02:27,554
So, I was destined to hear that infidel's
name one more time before I die.

7
00:02:30,895 --> 00:02:34,030
Our enemies are left for us by
our ancestors.

8
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:39,900
This is true, Osman Bey. We couldn't deal
with that devil with Ertugrul Bey, but...

9
00:02:40,190 --> 00:02:45,140
You are going to kill him now,
in sha Allah ( If Allah permits).

10
00:02:46,563 --> 00:02:50,833
His enemies raided his tent and
killed his family.

11
00:02:51,706 --> 00:02:55,396
They captured his two brothers.
He escaped.

12
00:02:55,396 --> 00:02:59,746
He grew up in the forest. People say
he drank pig milk.

13
00:03:00,513 --> 00:03:02,931
Then an ominous shaman found him and
raise him.

14
00:03:02,931 --> 00:03:06,351
-Is this why they call Togay black shaman?
-Yes my Bey.

15
00:03:08,348 --> 00:03:11,878
- What about his brothers?
- Togay saved them.

16
00:03:11,977 --> 00:03:14,557
Now they are working together.

17
00:03:16,108 --> 00:03:20,118
I heard people were talking about
this when I was in Aleppo, my Bey.

18
00:03:20,197 --> 00:03:26,307
His soldiers believe that water can't
drown him, fire can't burn him.

19
00:03:29,908 --> 00:03:35,308
We hadn't had such an enemy
for a long time.

20
00:03:36,706 --> 00:03:41,396
Beys!
Sharpen your swords.

21
00:03:41,791 --> 00:03:44,301
Feel the vengeance.

22
00:03:45,024 --> 00:03:50,014
If I can't tear him up and bait him
to the birds...

23
00:03:50,187 --> 00:03:57,117
Do not call me Ertugrul Ghazi's son
Osman Bey.

24
00:04:01,711 --> 00:04:08,541
Geyhatu sent this to hamper our
occupancy policy.

25
00:04:09,115 --> 00:04:14,265
We're going to have a lot of troubles
now that Togay is here, my Bey.

26
00:04:14,987 --> 00:04:23,027
There will be a meeting for Beys in Sogut.
Umur Bey said he'll accept my invitation.

27
00:04:24,377 --> 00:04:28,977
All the Beys are coming to Sogut.

28
00:04:30,755 --> 00:04:35,155
Except for Dodurga's Bey Ivaz.

29
00:04:36,091 --> 00:04:39,362
We need to take precautions, brother.

30
00:04:39,362 --> 00:04:43,712
- Don't worry, my Bey.
- Eyvallah, eyvallah (thank you).

31
00:04:44,817 --> 00:04:48,965
Davut Bey, take Goktug out.

32
00:04:48,965 --> 00:04:52,135
I need to talk to my brother.

33
00:04:56,173 --> 00:04:58,413
Osman Bey.

34
00:05:08,229 --> 00:05:14,609
As Osman Bey came this far and invited me
to the meeting...

35
00:05:14,629 --> 00:05:17,229
he should be expecting a lot from me.

36
00:05:17,345 --> 00:05:21,935
He probably will announce a conquest as
he invited all the Beys.

37
00:05:24,216 --> 00:05:26,906
We'll see.

38
00:05:27,106 --> 00:05:31,736
I wasn't sure whether you'd accept Osman
Bey's occupancy invitation....

39
00:05:31,736 --> 00:05:33,436
after reading my letter.

40
00:05:33,436 --> 00:05:37,886
There's no one to offer us something like
this.

41
00:05:37,886 --> 00:05:41,996
Do you think Anatolian Beys will invite
Kızıl Bey to such an event?

42
00:05:42,058 --> 00:05:49,208
Without permission, we can't even graze
our sheeps in Germiyanoglu, Konya.

43
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:53,319
Wherever we want to locate, there's always
an owner.

44
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:55,899
Isn't this land ours, father?

45
00:05:55,926 --> 00:06:01,990
Are Ertugrul Ghazi and Osman Bey the
owner just because they defeated Byzantine?

46
00:06:03,030 --> 00:06:04,840
Yes, of course daughter.

47
00:06:06,489 --> 00:06:10,589
We must fight the infidels to gain land.

48
00:06:11,181 --> 00:06:16,351
Look around.
Is there a stronger Bey than Osman?

49
00:06:16,865 --> 00:06:19,352
No of course, but...

50
00:06:19,352 --> 00:06:25,062
Osman Bey is surrounded with enemies and
betrayers. I am not sure Kayı's are safe.

51
00:06:25,528 --> 00:06:31,988
Their safety is our safety.
It's all the same.

52
00:06:33,657 --> 00:06:38,457
Whoever survives will carry
Turk's flag, daughter.

53
00:06:41,164 --> 00:06:46,904
We were right about the treason issue
after Osman Bey survived an ambush.

54
00:06:47,365 --> 00:06:53,835
Look at me. Treason doesn't come from
others.

55
00:06:53,873 --> 00:06:56,073
It comes from the nearests.

56
00:06:57,474 --> 00:06:59,774
Don't forget.

57
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:05,020
You were going to give me an evidence.
What was that?

58
00:07:05,752 --> 00:07:08,542
I talked about an homicide in my latter.

59
00:07:10,153 --> 00:07:12,633
I found this in the direction
of assassin.

60
00:07:24,826 --> 00:07:29,386
Let's see whose finger fits.

61
00:07:34,353 --> 00:07:39,923
That you killed Flatyos prevented me
from finding the betrayer, brother.

62
00:07:40,576 --> 00:07:45,596
It was my right, Osman Bey.
That kill was my right.

63
00:07:46,934 --> 00:07:50,004
Uncle Dündar thinks the same.

64
00:07:55,262 --> 00:08:02,782
Did Uncle Dündar talk to you before
or after you killed Flatyos.

65
00:08:04,597 --> 00:08:07,447
Does it matter, Osman Bey?

66
00:08:08,402 --> 00:08:10,542
It does a lot, brother.

67
00:08:16,518 --> 00:08:18,424
Just before I killed Flatyos.

68
00:08:18,424 --> 00:08:24,964
If you are angry so much, let's use it
in a different way. Help me, brother.

69
00:08:26,699 --> 00:08:35,513
Help me, brother, so that we can capture
the betrayer who caused Bayhoca's death.

70
00:08:35,513 --> 00:08:39,583
I'd love to help you on that.

71
00:08:39,618 --> 00:08:41,368
Good.

72
00:08:44,690 --> 00:08:47,480
Now listen to me, brother.

73
00:09:28,395 --> 00:09:31,798
Why didn't you attack Osman while getting
back from Umur Bey's?

74
00:09:31,798 --> 00:09:34,349
Why did not you kill Osman?

75
00:09:34,349 --> 00:09:41,370
The souls want brother blood, not
enemey blood.

76
00:09:41,370 --> 00:09:46,240
What soul are you talking about,
Togay?

77
00:09:46,273 --> 00:09:49,763
What is your aim if you're not intended
to kill Osman?

78
00:09:53,777 --> 00:09:58,688
Killing someone with an arrow is
stupid.

79
00:09:58,688 --> 00:10:05,218
An arrow of a master will set all the
tribes against each other.

80
00:10:05,218 --> 00:10:11,528
Turks care a lot about their family.

81
00:10:11,528 --> 00:10:18,258
This arrow will led to treason and
chaos.

82
00:10:19,665 --> 00:10:24,545
Okay. Tell me.
I am listening to you.

83
00:10:43,865 --> 00:10:49,015
If Osman dies, Gündüz takes over.

84
00:10:49,152 --> 00:10:52,460
If Savcı dies, someone else will
take over.

85
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:56,690
Osman's death won't stop the dream
of his father Ertugrul.

86
00:10:56,858 --> 00:11:02,208
What I want is not Osman's blood.

87
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:11,960
What I want is brother blood.

88
00:11:19,493 --> 00:11:21,593
Osman...

89
00:11:21,998 --> 00:11:25,248
Erlik Khan will give a terrible...

90
00:11:25,553 --> 00:11:31,323
nightmare to Osman.

91
00:11:41,443 --> 00:11:46,063
We heard about a meeting Osman
arranged in Sogut.

92
00:11:46,063 --> 00:11:48,887
Osman Bey is taking precautions.

93
00:11:48,887 --> 00:11:53,955
The Beys Osman is gathering for occupancy
will participate.

94
00:11:53,955 --> 00:11:58,375
Except for Dodurga's Bey Ivaz.

95
00:11:58,375 --> 00:12:03,765
What are you going to do while there are
too many precautions taken in Sogut, Togay?

96
00:12:03,832 --> 00:12:09,632
Ivaz Bey will give me brother blood.

97
00:12:11,597 --> 00:12:17,457
When Togay's arrow hits, Osman's and his
father's dreams will collapse.

98
00:12:17,746 --> 00:12:20,209
All the Beys will turn against Osman Bey.

99
00:12:20,209 --> 00:12:23,529
Is your aim going to be Ivaz Bey?

100
00:12:23,657 --> 00:12:28,797
I will aim Ivaz Bey but shoot Umur Bey.

101
00:12:31,208 --> 00:12:35,678
- How are you going to get in the meeting?
- A snake can pop up from any hole.

102
00:12:41,855 --> 00:12:45,735
Then I shall show you the way
you'll crawl in like a snake.

103
00:12:46,430 --> 00:12:50,730
Since we arrived in Sogut, we dig
tunnels everywhere.

104
00:12:51,398 --> 00:12:56,748
Now you are here, this way goes to Church,
this one goes to the caravanserai

105
00:12:59,009 --> 00:13:04,229
This tunnel leads you to the kitchen of
caravanserai.

106
00:13:05,810 --> 00:13:08,810
Without alarming anyone.

107
00:13:09,592 --> 00:13:14,042
Only snake-minded people like you
would think of that.

108
00:13:33,219 --> 00:13:36,309
I don't want any trouble in Sogut.

109
00:13:37,621 --> 00:13:40,981
We won't allow for treason.

110
00:13:42,154 --> 00:13:47,254
My Bala, I want you to come t omorrow.

111
00:13:48,185 --> 00:13:50,745
You can look after Hatuns.

112
00:13:58,642 --> 00:14:04,992
Don't worry, my Bey. No one can attack
while I'm there.

113
00:14:07,236 --> 00:14:12,696
No doubt, my Bala. You accomplished
every duty I assigned you.

114
00:14:20,138 --> 00:14:22,298
What about Umur Bey?

115
00:14:25,264 --> 00:14:30,194
I invited Umur bey too.
He'll come.

116
00:14:35,464 --> 00:14:38,424
So we are going to see Malhun Hatun again.

117
00:14:42,856 --> 00:14:47,826
Umur Bey doesn't have a son,
so his daughter will come.

118
00:14:49,532 --> 00:14:54,612
If he had a son, Malhun Hatun wouldn't
be in the forefront.

119
00:14:58,025 --> 00:15:03,675
She is a daughter of Bey, but you are
the daughter of Sheik Edebalı.

120
00:15:05,169 --> 00:15:10,899
When she understands that, she'll
stop dominating you.

121
00:15:22,981 --> 00:15:38,551
- Singing a Lullaby -

122
00:16:03,948 --> 00:16:07,088
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim.
(in the name of Allah the compassionate the merciful)

123
00:16:22,138 --> 00:16:30,408
Our prophet says we'll be summoned with
our names and our father's name...

124
00:16:31,007 --> 00:16:36,597
so we must name our children beautifully.

125
00:16:38,863 --> 00:16:42,533
You name shall be Ertuğrul.

126
00:16:44,363 --> 00:16:47,036
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim.
(in the name of Allah the compassionate the merciful)

127
00:16:47,036 --> 00:16:52,666
Allah-u Akbar x4
(Allah is Great!)

128
00:16:52,969 --> 00:16:58,739
Ashhadu an la ilaha illa Allah. x2
(I bear witness that there is no god except the One Allah)

129
00:16:58,884 --> 00:17:04,554
Ashadu anna Muhammadan Rasool Allah. x2
(I bear witness that Muhammad is the messenger of Allah)

130
00:17:04,590 --> 00:17:07,480
Hayya 'ala-s-Salah x2
(Hurry to the prayer)

131
00:17:07,659 --> 00:17:10,585
Hayya 'ala-l-Falah. x2
(Hurry to salvation.)

132
00:17:10,585 --> 00:17:13,125
Allah-u Akbar x2
(Allah is Great!)

133
00:17:13,321 --> 00:17:16,741
La ilaha illa Allah.
(There's no god except for Allah)

134
00:17:19,228 --> 00:17:21,665
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim.
(in the name of Allah the compassionate the merciful)

135
00:17:21,665 --> 00:17:27,345
Allah-u Akbar x4
(Allah is Great!)

136
00:17:28,170 --> 00:17:32,622
Ashhadu an la ilaha illa Allah. x2
(I bear witness that there is no god except the One Allah)

137
00:17:32,932 --> 00:17:38,266
Ashadu anna Muhammadan Rasool Allah. x2
(I bear witness that Muhammad is the messenger of Allah)

138
00:17:38,266 --> 00:17:41,056
Hayya 'ala-s-Salah x2
(Hurry to the prayer)

139
00:17:41,056 --> 00:17:43,956
Hayya 'ala-l-Falah. x2
(Hurry to salvation.)

140
00:17:44,356 --> 00:17:47,166
As-salatu Khayrun Minan-nawm. x2
(Prayer is better than sleep.)

141
00:17:47,166 --> 00:17:50,136
Allah-u Akbar x2
(Allah is Great!)

142
00:17:50,336 --> 00:17:52,773
La ilaha illa Allah.
(There's no god except for Allah)

143
00:17:57,640 --> 00:18:02,751
Your name is Ertugrul.
Your name is Ertugrul.

144
00:18:02,751 --> 00:18:05,981
Your name is Ertugrul.

145
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:42,880
Savcı, if you allow, I want to visit
Sheik Edebalı soon.

146
00:18:43,684 --> 00:18:45,914
Why, Hatun?

147
00:18:48,347 --> 00:18:51,847
I heard Sheik in the funeral of Bayhoca.

148
00:18:52,532 --> 00:18:57,960
In Quran, it says "Do not say of those who are
killed in the Way of Allah: They are dead!

149
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:04,550
Nay, they are alive, but you do not
perceive (their existence). [2/Al-Baqarah-154]

150
00:19:05,937 --> 00:19:09,327
Our Lord said this in his book.

151
00:19:09,327 --> 00:19:14,397
I want to know these,
I want to be a Muslim.

152
00:20:16,509 --> 00:20:20,550
- No one will enter with their swords.
- Are Beys included, my Bey?

153
00:20:20,550 --> 00:20:24,050
- Beys are included.
- As you command, my Bey.

154
00:21:51,843 --> 00:21:54,833
Here is Osman's gift.

155
00:22:26,986 --> 00:22:30,406
Gonca Hatun, what are you doing here?

156
00:22:32,094 --> 00:22:34,337
We are here with Bala Hatun.

157
00:22:34,337 --> 00:22:36,797
We are helping out.

158
00:22:42,585 --> 00:22:47,645
Where is that smile coming from,
Boran Alp?

159
00:22:48,857 --> 00:22:52,007
I started the wedding preparations
on the other hand.

160
00:22:57,692 --> 00:23:02,612
Good, I did too.

161
00:23:04,645 --> 00:23:09,195
As Osman Bey said, we are going to go to
both battle and wedding.

162
00:23:09,810 --> 00:23:17,020
We'll kill the enemy, we'll give birth to
our children, we'll go on surviving Gonca.

163
00:23:43,993 --> 00:23:49,623
Umur Bey, excuse me but I need to
take your swords.

164
00:23:50,012 --> 00:23:51,421
Why is that?

165
00:23:51,421 --> 00:23:54,481
Osman Bey commanded for the sake of
security.

166
00:24:13,540 --> 00:24:15,830
Take it then.

167
00:24:41,611 --> 00:24:43,291
This way.

168
00:25:48,031 --> 00:25:50,101
He is coming!

169
00:26:18,931 --> 00:26:23,191
You brought us peace.

170
00:26:23,210 --> 00:26:25,240
Welcome.

171
00:26:27,206 --> 00:26:29,826
Here.

172
00:26:45,511 --> 00:26:48,951
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim.
(In the name of Allah, the merciful the compassionate.)

173
00:26:50,028 --> 00:26:59,608
With the name of Allah's ninety nine name,
who is able to...

174
00:26:59,608 --> 00:27:05,156
create, who fulfills our hearts
with faith.

175
00:28:09,953 --> 00:28:12,713
How are you going to shoot it?

176
00:28:23,827 --> 00:28:25,697
Just like that.

177
00:29:00,671 --> 00:29:03,371
This arrow...

178
00:29:04,189 --> 00:29:09,039
will erase Osman's dignity.

179
00:29:45,512 --> 00:29:50,072
My Oghuz Father's heritage,
my valiant brothers.

180
00:29:50,177 --> 00:29:53,767
You all accepted our invitation.

181
00:29:54,006 --> 00:29:59,686
- Thank you.
- Eyvallah, (Thank you) Osman Bey.

182
00:30:02,567 --> 00:30:07,507
Now you must be wondering the reason...

183
00:30:07,663 --> 00:30:12,973
why I invted you to this meeting, and
the good news I'll deliver.

184
00:30:49,661 --> 00:30:57,671
Here is the Inegol castle, where we are
going to weaken through...

185
00:30:58,903 --> 00:31:02,043
our mind, destroy with our strenght.

186
00:31:45,105 --> 00:31:49,375
Do not relieve with the strenght
of the crowd. My father is inside...

187
00:31:49,375 --> 00:31:51,429
without his sword.
Keep your eyes wide open.

188
00:31:51,429 --> 00:31:53,479
Yes, my Hanım.

189
00:32:00,591 --> 00:32:03,291
Do you want anything, inshallah?

190
00:32:03,765 --> 00:32:06,485
No, except for our swords.

191
00:32:15,502 --> 00:32:21,862
Bala, this Hatun must know her limits.

192
00:32:22,779 --> 00:32:28,589
She is guest, Gonca.
Let's mind our own business.

193
00:33:02,185 --> 00:33:10,895
This is Sogut. We have Bozoyuk, Inegol,
and here Eskisehir in our south.

194
00:33:11,801 --> 00:33:16,241
In the north, Bilecik and Yarhisar.

195
00:33:16,598 --> 00:33:20,338
In the west, we have Bursa.

196
00:33:22,052 --> 00:33:28,412
And there is Inegol between
us and Bursa.

197
00:33:35,431 --> 00:33:41,031
The most savage infidel is
Inegol's Lord.

198
00:33:49,579 --> 00:33:54,799
He is not only trying to break us through
great bazaars and trade routes...

199
00:33:56,301 --> 00:34:01,261
He also tries to kill Muslim in
every chance he gets.

200
00:34:08,778 --> 00:34:13,898
This castle has an important role.

201
00:34:15,994 --> 00:34:22,004
After conquering it, we will be able
to move freely.

202
00:34:35,154 --> 00:34:37,174
Alps.

203
00:34:38,825 --> 00:34:41,315
See it yourself.

204
00:36:46,582 --> 00:36:48,812
Who are you?

205
00:38:17,909 --> 00:38:22,129
Inegol Lord is in Constantinie.

206
00:38:25,979 --> 00:38:34,559
If we don't move, he'll come back to banish
all the Turkmen Beys from this land.

207
00:38:36,843 --> 00:38:40,723
What do you mean by "move", Osman Bey?

208
00:38:46,989 --> 00:38:51,699
What I am saying is that we should
gather our Alps.

209
00:38:52,462 --> 00:38:57,872
We should come together,
and go to Inegol.

210
00:38:58,978 --> 00:39:07,518
Break all the links between Inegol Castle
and Bilecik and Keles.

211
00:39:07,996 --> 00:39:16,636
And we shall conquer Inegol Castle
while shouting "Allah Allah".

212
00:39:44,391 --> 00:39:50,711
Osman Bey, Inegol Castle
is difficult to conquer.

213
00:40:02,300 --> 00:40:07,730
However, a lion who conquered Kulucahisar
Castle...

214
00:40:08,014 --> 00:40:11,984
can conquer Inegol castle, too.

215
00:40:18,515 --> 00:40:21,505
I trust you with all my heart.

216
00:40:28,132 --> 00:40:35,642
Your father Ertugrul Ghazi gifted Turks
Osman Bey, other than Kayı Tribe...

217
00:40:35,673 --> 00:40:39,783
May Allah bless him.

218
00:40:40,837 --> 00:40:45,497
Eyvallah, eyvallah (thank you)
Umur Bey.

219
00:41:12,246 --> 00:41:16,878
Conquer is ours, victory is Allah's.

220
00:41:16,878 --> 00:41:20,028
Inshallah.
(If Allah permits)

221
00:41:20,975 --> 00:41:27,996
Inshallah, we will honour Inegol with
Islam and Turkishness.

222
00:41:27,996 --> 00:41:31,026
Inshallah.
(If Allah permits)

223
00:41:39,178 --> 00:41:46,769
And Inegol Castle will be the greates
castle we have ever conquered.

224
00:41:46,769 --> 00:41:49,309
Inshallah, my Bey.
(If Allah permits)

225
00:41:53,470 --> 00:41:56,060
Inshallah.
(If Allah permits)

226
00:43:38,299 --> 00:43:44,808
My Beys, we shall try,
Allah will decide.

227
00:43:44,808 --> 00:43:46,618
Amin.

228
00:43:50,890 --> 00:43:52,480
Alps!

229
00:43:55,151 --> 00:43:57,821
It came from the kitchen!

230
00:43:58,058 --> 00:43:59,788
Hurry!

231
00:44:05,249 --> 00:44:07,649
Watch out Beys!

232
00:44:12,472 --> 00:44:14,762
Soldier!

233
00:44:25,515 --> 00:44:28,015
Take Beys out!

234
00:44:29,812 --> 00:44:33,982
- Take Beys out!
- Father!

235
00:44:34,315 --> 00:44:36,145
Hurry!

236
00:44:39,369 --> 00:44:42,629
Father! Father!

237
00:44:46,104 --> 00:44:48,334
Father! Father!

238
00:44:49,217 --> 00:44:50,868
Hurry!

239
00:44:50,868 --> 00:44:53,878
Father, are you okay?

240
00:44:55,083 --> 00:44:58,353
Hurry! Hurry!

241
00:44:58,506 --> 00:45:02,026
Close the enterance and exit!

242
00:45:02,133 --> 00:45:03,333
Hurry Alps!

243
00:45:08,340 --> 00:45:11,280
Blow out the fire!

244
00:45:11,704 --> 00:45:13,924
Cerkutay!

245
00:45:17,591 --> 00:45:20,101
- Alps!
- Father, are you okay?

246
00:45:20,470 --> 00:45:23,446
Father who did this to you?

247
00:45:23,446 --> 00:45:24,956
Alps!

248
00:45:45,812 --> 00:45:48,222
They came through the tunnel.

249
00:45:48,233 --> 00:45:51,053
We'll find them, brother.

250
00:45:59,232 --> 00:46:02,112
Hurry brother, hurry.

251
00:46:08,466 --> 00:46:12,456
Where is the doctor?
Call the doctor!

252
00:46:13,040 --> 00:46:16,187
Doctor!
Where is the doctor?

253
00:46:16,187 --> 00:46:17,787
This way.

254
00:46:19,314 --> 00:46:21,687
Umur Bey.
Umur Bey.

255
00:46:21,687 --> 00:46:26,325
Daughter, the tribe is entrusted to you.

256
00:46:26,325 --> 00:46:29,825
No, father no!
Hold on!

257
00:46:30,950 --> 00:46:33,750
Where is the doctor?

258
00:46:38,291 --> 00:46:41,871
Who are they?
Who are they?

259
00:46:58,813 --> 00:47:01,063
Where is the doctor?

260
00:47:01,115 --> 00:47:03,985
Father, open your eyes!
Father!

261
00:47:25,035 --> 00:47:28,145
You couldn't secure the meeting
Osman Bey!

262
00:47:31,737 --> 00:47:36,437
Whose arrow is this?
Which infidel's is this arrow?

263
00:47:46,061 --> 00:47:49,041
Hold on father!

264
00:47:59,542 --> 00:48:04,542
Father, open your eyes!
Father, hold on, father!

265
00:48:04,910 --> 00:48:08,540
Father open your eyes!
Hold on, father!

266
00:48:29,874 --> 00:48:35,134
How can this happen despite all the
precautions?

267
00:48:35,499 --> 00:48:39,742
How can this happen?
Tell me!

268
00:48:39,742 --> 00:48:41,762
Tell me!

269
00:48:58,416 --> 00:49:04,886
In my meeting, in my presence,
how can Beys be hurt?

270
00:49:05,329 --> 00:49:09,539
How can be?

271
00:49:11,928 --> 00:49:16,768
Answer me!
Answer me!

272
00:49:51,356 --> 00:49:53,536
Bamsı Bey.

273
00:49:55,238 --> 00:49:57,838
Brother.

274
00:50:00,839 --> 00:50:03,339
Come here.

275
00:50:11,349 --> 00:50:16,279
This is a Dodurga arrow.

276
00:50:31,549 --> 00:50:37,729
Yıvaz Bey...
This is impossible, Osman Bey.

277
00:50:40,756 --> 00:50:46,436
Even though he didn't join us, I don't
think Yıvaz Bey would do such a thing.

278
00:50:50,394 --> 00:50:55,424
This is devil's job.

279
00:50:59,709 --> 00:51:02,649
How can we be sure, my Bey?

280
00:51:11,647 --> 00:51:14,207
Alps!

281
00:51:16,388 --> 00:51:18,388
Get ready.

282
00:51:53,802 --> 00:51:57,852
Unfortunately, he isn't doing great because
of the poison in the arrow. We'll wait.

283
00:51:57,852 --> 00:52:03,242
- May Allah heal him.
- Are we going to wait? How, huh?

284
00:52:04,311 --> 00:52:08,411
Do something.
Cure him!

285
00:52:09,683 --> 00:52:13,973
Do something.
I can't wait my father to die.

286
00:52:13,973 --> 00:52:17,023
I'll prepare a remedy.

287
00:52:22,730 --> 00:52:27,844
We'll find and punish whoever
did this to my father, Bahadır Bey.

288
00:52:27,844 --> 00:52:34,024
Gather Alps at once.
Let's see what the issue is.

289
00:52:34,814 --> 00:52:37,944
As you command, Malhun Hatun.

290
00:52:47,060 --> 00:52:53,930
If something happens to you,
I'll set everywhere on fire.

291
00:52:59,030 --> 00:53:05,070
We trusted Osman Bey's words and security.
We almost died.

292
00:53:06,437 --> 00:53:13,127
So we shouldn't have trusted him. Most of
the Beys are returning.

293
00:53:13,423 --> 00:53:17,663
We made a mistake.
A huge mistake.

294
00:53:18,385 --> 00:53:23,035
We should have taken lessons from
the previous incident in which Beys died.

295
00:53:24,783 --> 00:53:29,252
Now, this is not the right time to
talk about this.

296
00:53:29,252 --> 00:53:35,892
Savcı Bey! Osman Bey is talking about
conquering Inegol Castle...

297
00:53:36,410 --> 00:53:41,210
while he cannot even secure his
own meeting.

298
00:53:41,318 --> 00:53:43,948
What are we going to talk about?
About that?

299
00:53:43,948 --> 00:53:49,228
He is right. He is talking about
conquering Inegol Castle.

300
00:53:49,802 --> 00:53:56,264
And he will. We want from you to
benefit the conquer.

301
00:53:56,264 --> 00:54:02,514
This is good deeds, but he needs to
spot the enemy first.

302
00:54:02,747 --> 00:54:08,587
Otherwise, we will end up like
Durhan and Ali Bey.

303
00:54:17,027 --> 00:54:22,207
Osman Bey took revenge of martyred
Beys.

304
00:54:22,214 --> 00:54:25,234
Why aren't you talking about that?

305
00:54:25,689 --> 00:54:30,279
We need to think of something before
we die, Dündar Bey.

306
00:54:30,506 --> 00:54:36,136
When Osman Bey comes back from Dodurga,
we'll tell him about our feelings as well.

307
00:54:57,406 --> 00:54:59,676
Osman Bey!

308
00:55:04,581 --> 00:55:07,921
Where are you going, Osman Bey?

309
00:55:10,620 --> 00:55:13,380
You invited us, we came.

310
00:55:14,342 --> 00:55:18,916
We trusted your securty, your words.

311
00:55:18,916 --> 00:55:21,776
Is this how you secure people?

312
00:55:25,390 --> 00:55:32,840
Malhun Hatun, do not talk while
you are angry.

313
00:55:33,604 --> 00:55:39,624
My anger doesn't make me blind, Osman Bey.
My trust for you made me blind.

314
00:55:41,668 --> 00:55:44,708
Otherwise, this would not have happened.

315
00:55:49,985 --> 00:55:54,595
Malhun Hatun, get away.

316
00:55:55,549 --> 00:56:00,799
Get away so that I find the betrayer.

317
00:56:02,210 --> 00:56:05,430
Is there something you know?
Tell me.

318
00:56:10,401 --> 00:56:15,421
I cannot accuse anyone without
knowing it for sure.

319
00:56:18,028 --> 00:56:23,128
So you don't have an evidence, huh?
You only suspect.

320
00:56:25,642 --> 00:56:30,302
I want evidence, Osman Bey.

321
00:56:31,999 --> 00:56:35,129
I want blood.

322
00:56:41,411 --> 00:56:46,141
Go now, Osman Bey.

323
00:56:57,277 --> 00:56:59,317
Alps!

324
00:57:05,408 --> 00:57:08,238
You spoiled our trust.

325
00:57:19,565 --> 00:57:22,205
Go!

326
00:57:23,335 --> 00:57:24,665
Go!

327
00:57:42,487 --> 00:57:49,027
How can this happen, Bala? Who are we going
to trust if even Dodurga's Bey does this?

328
00:57:50,556 --> 00:57:52,696
It's not clear yet, Gonca.

329
00:57:53,697 --> 00:57:56,127
Osman Bey will figure it out.

330
00:58:50,096 --> 00:58:55,846
Osman Bey.
He lost his dignity while...

331
00:58:56,950 --> 00:58:59,244
he was trying to conquer
Inegol Castle.

332
00:58:59,244 --> 00:59:04,894
Spread fear not only in Beys,
but also in Kayıs.

333
00:59:05,692 --> 00:59:09,756
The Beys Osman invited to the meeting
will accuse him.

334
00:59:09,756 --> 00:59:14,456
Osman is wise.
Sooner or later he will erase the fear...

335
00:59:15,533 --> 00:59:19,593
we spread in his people.

336
00:59:21,579 --> 00:59:26,869
Osman spoiled everyone's trust.
We will continue night and day.

337
00:59:28,510 --> 00:59:33,640
We had a good partnership
with you Togay.

338
00:59:38,041 --> 00:59:43,451
Not a partnership you can make with Togay,
only a good leather boots you make to me.

339
00:59:51,407 --> 00:59:54,107
You know where to find me.

340
00:59:55,321 --> 00:59:59,761
Provoke not only Beys, but also
the merchants.

341
01:00:02,832 --> 01:00:05,792
The distrust against Osman...

342
01:00:07,113 --> 01:00:09,083
will get in everybody's mind...

343
01:00:10,677 --> 01:00:14,167
like a dark cloud...

344
01:00:14,748 --> 01:00:17,238
all around.

345
01:00:18,420 --> 01:00:23,510
Then the tribes will fall into each other.

346
01:00:30,013 --> 01:00:33,504
Malhun Hatun is suspicious.

347
01:00:33,504 --> 01:00:37,294
Malhun Hatun will attack Ivaz Bey...

348
01:00:38,597 --> 01:00:44,957
with her alps because of my arrow.

349
01:00:45,737 --> 01:00:52,247
Then Turks will drink each other's
blood.

350
01:00:55,153 --> 01:00:59,233
What about you?
What are you going to do?

351
01:01:00,079 --> 01:01:05,559
I'll meet Erlik Khan's dark souls.

352
01:01:06,326 --> 01:01:12,136
Dark Souls are going to able me to
talk to my father.

353
01:01:16,420 --> 01:01:23,370
My father will tell me how to kill Osman,

354
01:01:24,701 --> 01:01:27,911
who is his biggest enemy Ertugrul's son.

355
01:01:53,314 --> 01:01:57,053
Togay is Noyan's son, huh?

356
01:01:57,053 --> 01:02:02,793
Not only his son.
He is also carries Noyan's soul...

357
01:02:03,735 --> 01:02:08,485
in his ominous body.

358
01:02:26,701 --> 01:02:30,351
Wake up Umur Bey, wake up.

359
01:02:32,729 --> 01:02:38,309
If you don't, no one can sleep well.

360
01:02:41,346 --> 01:02:47,216
I'll make them beg for their death,
to the ones who did this to you.

361
01:02:49,804 --> 01:02:52,354
Can I come in?

362
01:02:56,100 --> 01:02:58,220
Come.

363
01:03:07,739 --> 01:03:11,461
- How are the Alps doing?
- Bahadır Bey gathered them all.

364
01:03:11,461 --> 01:03:14,081
They are waiting for your command.

365
01:03:18,110 --> 01:03:21,076
What is wrong with you?
Tell me.

366
01:03:21,076 --> 01:03:24,816
They say Dodurga's Bey did this betrayal
to our Bey.

367
01:03:28,007 --> 01:03:33,457
- Who said this?
- I heard Bala Hatun and Gonca Hatun.

368
01:03:42,057 --> 01:03:46,207
Dodurga's Bey, huh?
Ivaz Bey.

369
01:03:48,510 --> 01:03:50,930
That's why he didn't come.

370
01:03:55,522 --> 01:03:58,902
I'll kill that betrayer, father.

371
01:03:59,593 --> 01:04:02,473
Vengeance is my right.

372
01:04:21,634 --> 01:04:28,334
We run away from Mongols and came
here for security.

373
01:04:29,220 --> 01:04:34,020
But as we can see, the fire of treason
is burning this land.

374
01:04:34,295 --> 01:04:38,575
Now it's time to put out the fire of
treason!

375
01:04:38,610 --> 01:04:43,050
It's time to take revenge of our Bey!

376
01:04:55,463 --> 01:04:59,833
Let's see how Umur Bey is doing.

377
01:05:04,720 --> 01:05:07,040
Where are you going, Malhun Hatun.

378
01:05:07,325 --> 01:05:09,505
Get away from my way.

379
01:05:09,889 --> 01:05:11,999
I asked where you are going.

380
01:05:12,806 --> 01:05:17,496
I'm going to take revenge of my father.
Get away from my way!

381
01:05:19,838 --> 01:05:26,128
Hatun! Osman Bey will punish the
assassination on his own!

382
01:05:26,573 --> 01:05:29,383
You exceeded your limits, Hatun!

383
01:05:33,891 --> 01:05:38,291
Do whatever you need to do then!

384
01:05:47,588 --> 01:05:49,918
Do not step in!

385
01:05:50,410 --> 01:05:53,450
Stop, Gonca.

386
01:05:56,223 --> 01:05:59,853
Malhun Hatun.
Bala Hatun.

387
01:06:10,292 --> 01:06:12,502
You!

388
01:06:24,079 --> 01:06:29,299
Malhun Hatun, Ivaz Bey is sinless.

389
01:06:30,940 --> 01:06:35,400
Apparently, there's something wrong
about this.

390
01:06:36,001 --> 01:06:38,681
They want us to suspect him.

391
01:06:38,786 --> 01:06:44,556
I want vengeance Osman Bey. The game will
reveal itself when the revenge is taken.

392
01:06:53,993 --> 01:06:55,823
Alps!

393
01:07:04,944 --> 01:07:07,734
Stop.

394
01:07:11,507 --> 01:07:13,387
Alps!

395
01:07:21,303 --> 01:07:26,143
Malhun Hatun, you can ask Umur Bey.

396
01:07:26,143 --> 01:07:30,483
We are not so vile to shoot
a Turkmen Bey.

397
01:07:34,094 --> 01:07:36,894
Ivaz Bey is right.

398
01:07:49,231 --> 01:07:54,201
My suspect is apparent unless
you bring me the guilty.

399
01:07:55,820 --> 01:07:59,410
Don't you trust me, Malhun Hatun?

400
01:08:00,303 --> 01:08:05,683
My father trusted you and he is
at the death's door right now.

401
01:08:12,022 --> 01:08:13,742
I understand your anger.

402
01:08:16,577 --> 01:08:22,477
But our enemy is common. They're trying
to set us against each other.

403
01:08:24,867 --> 01:08:28,068
The meeting is mine.

404
01:08:28,068 --> 01:08:32,248
I am responsible for this.

405
01:08:33,407 --> 01:08:39,367
First, we'll find out what's going on,
then we kill the guilty ones!

406
01:08:47,022 --> 01:08:51,582
We shall trust you this time,
see what happens.

407
01:08:55,076 --> 01:08:58,706
Everybody get back on their duty!

408
01:09:13,095 --> 01:09:17,535
My Bala, calm down.

409
01:10:03,614 --> 01:10:05,934
You wanted to talk to me.

410
01:10:07,667 --> 01:10:10,017
I am listening.

411
01:10:11,288 --> 01:10:16,308
Osman Bey, we trusted your word,
came here.

412
01:10:17,209 --> 01:10:22,969
We gathered in a room, trusting
your security.

413
01:10:23,621 --> 01:10:28,711
Umur Bey was shot with a poisonous arrow.
We almost died.

414
01:10:30,180 --> 01:10:36,780
You think you made a mistake by
trusting me.

415
01:10:39,653 --> 01:10:45,223
And the incidents we experienced today
proves you are right.

416
01:10:46,857 --> 01:10:48,977
Then there is nothing to talk about.

417
01:10:50,230 --> 01:10:54,991
Our visit shall ends here.
We want to go back to our tents.

418
01:10:54,991 --> 01:11:01,691
If you leave now, what enemy wants
will happen then.

419
01:11:02,983 --> 01:11:08,473
We don't even know our enemy, how
can you be sure about what they want?

420
01:11:12,397 --> 01:11:16,078
We'll depart with the sunrise tomorrow.

421
01:11:16,078 --> 01:11:21,378
We'll talk this through in our tent,
then decide.

422
01:11:21,614 --> 01:11:27,254
But your dream, conquering Inegol,
is not likely to happen.

423
01:11:40,673 --> 01:11:42,523
So...

424
01:11:44,447 --> 01:11:47,447
you are telling me that I should
give up on my dream?

425
01:11:50,862 --> 01:11:53,952
So, I should give up on my dream.

426
01:11:54,925 --> 01:12:00,365
I am not telling you to give up on your
lives, I am not telling you that...

427
01:12:00,365 --> 01:12:03,875
this unity is more important
than your lives....

428
01:12:03,915 --> 01:12:10,395
I am not telling you that your lives are
worthless without this unity.

429
01:12:11,812 --> 01:12:16,792
I am telling you to face your fears.

430
01:12:18,326 --> 01:12:23,486
You are in fear because you can't unite.

431
01:12:30,385 --> 01:12:36,455
You are nomad. You have no castle to
take cover when enemy attacks you.

432
01:12:37,359 --> 01:12:39,855
You are open to any attack.

433
01:12:39,855 --> 01:12:44,745
Infidels will come crowded.

434
01:12:44,998 --> 01:12:49,008
They will tear your tents up!

435
01:12:50,147 --> 01:12:51,767
Tell me...

436
01:12:55,982 --> 01:13:02,492
From whom you are going to seek help,
if you don't unite?

437
01:13:07,338 --> 01:13:12,378
United we stand, divided we fall.

438
01:13:14,023 --> 01:13:18,913
If we unite, we become a state.

439
01:13:25,079 --> 01:13:32,429
And infidels should know they are
attacking a state, not only a tent.

440
01:13:33,863 --> 01:13:38,893
They'll know that we'll take
revenge.

441
01:13:39,830 --> 01:13:45,800
And they won't dare to do it.

442
01:13:56,286 --> 01:13:58,666
Don't you want that?

443
01:14:01,739 --> 01:14:04,511
Of course we do, Osman Bey.
But...

444
01:14:04,511 --> 01:14:05,821
But...

445
01:14:08,491 --> 01:14:11,711
But the enemy doesn't want this.

446
01:14:12,067 --> 01:14:14,007
Right?

447
01:14:14,936 --> 01:14:17,456
Of course they don't.

448
01:14:18,331 --> 01:14:22,531
But we will push them!

449
01:14:22,533 --> 01:14:26,739
We will insist!
We will push!

450
01:14:26,739 --> 01:14:30,699
Beys! Brothers!

451
01:14:31,734 --> 01:14:34,844
This is not only a dream.

452
01:14:35,054 --> 01:14:40,584
But if you leave now...

453
01:14:40,906 --> 01:14:46,466
this is going to remain as a dream
for our children.

454
01:14:55,203 --> 01:14:58,213
I won't allow it.

455
01:15:10,842 --> 01:15:14,772
Turks need a state.

456
01:15:15,865 --> 01:15:20,405
Whoever turns his back on us,
Turks, who try to...

457
01:15:21,279 --> 01:15:26,729
establish a state, is not going to
see good the days.

458
01:15:30,384 --> 01:15:33,094
I won't give up.

459
01:15:33,666 --> 01:15:38,156
No matter you join me or not.

460
01:15:44,799 --> 01:15:52,259
Now tell me. Are you leaving
our unity?

461
01:16:25,512 --> 01:16:29,381
Malhun Hatun, you got tired.

462
01:16:29,381 --> 01:16:32,951
Eat and go to sleep.
I'll care.

463
01:16:33,706 --> 01:16:38,776
I won't shut my eyes before my
father opens his eyes, Bahadır Bey.

464
01:16:42,903 --> 01:16:46,523
- Daughter.
- Father.

465
01:16:47,742 --> 01:16:51,752
My father, thanks to our Lord.

466
01:16:55,929 --> 01:16:59,809
Who did this to me?

467
01:17:02,082 --> 01:17:05,352
I suspected Dodurga's Bey.

468
01:17:05,363 --> 01:17:08,457
What are you talking about, daughter?

469
01:17:08,457 --> 01:17:15,027
We have been friends with Ivaz
since forever.

470
01:17:16,078 --> 01:17:21,658
There's something wrong with this.

471
01:17:26,515 --> 01:17:30,025
Osman Bey says it's not Ivaz.

472
01:17:31,260 --> 01:17:34,030
He is right, daughter.

473
01:17:35,006 --> 01:17:38,946
This is a planned assassination.

474
01:17:40,463 --> 01:17:45,433
This is all because of Osman Bey's
recklessness, father.

475
01:17:52,821 --> 01:17:57,741
Don't think about it now.
Just heal up.

476
01:18:06,789 --> 01:18:09,209
My Bey, it's important.

477
01:18:10,923 --> 01:18:14,265
- Tell me.
- We made an investigation.

478
01:18:14,265 --> 01:18:18,255
We found some remnats of
the barrel with that arrow.
.

479
01:18:31,568 --> 01:18:36,918
My Bey, this is Mongol's job.

480
01:18:37,939 --> 01:18:41,239
This is Noyan's son's job.

481
01:18:44,670 --> 01:18:46,720
Togay.

482
01:18:55,107 --> 01:18:59,777
Cerkutay, you did a good job with Aygül.

483
01:19:00,071 --> 01:19:04,841
Now I know who to kill.

484
01:19:36,467 --> 01:19:41,877
Osman Bey keeps silent.

485
01:19:43,310 --> 01:19:46,220
He had better be quick, father.

486
01:19:51,093 --> 01:19:54,303
If he gets late, I'll take over.

487
01:19:55,037 --> 01:19:58,797
I'll find that betrayer, punish him
myself.

488
01:20:00,588 --> 01:20:05,838
Osman Bey has many enemies inside
and outside.

489
01:20:07,859 --> 01:20:13,689
Now, we are getting hurt because
of that.

490
01:20:15,218 --> 01:20:23,418
But, we did a great mistake by
trusting him.

491
01:20:30,331 --> 01:20:34,491
- Can I come in?
- Come.

492
01:20:52,057 --> 01:20:54,567
Excuse me, father.

493
01:21:12,219 --> 01:21:17,759
Osman's Alp found a sign.
This is Togay's job.

494
01:21:22,804 --> 01:21:25,164
Togay.

495
01:21:28,366 --> 01:21:32,499
Get the Alps ready.
We'll set off with the sunrise tomorrow.

496
01:21:32,499 --> 01:21:36,489
- We'll follow Togay.
- As you command, Malhun Hatun.

497
01:21:43,581 --> 01:21:45,721
Togay.

498
01:21:46,927 --> 01:21:49,507
Togay.

499
01:21:53,720 --> 01:21:57,872
We shed too much blood to get rid
of Noyan.

500
01:21:57,872 --> 01:22:02,952
Now his son Togay shows up.

501
01:22:08,694 --> 01:22:16,454
Bamsı Bey, Togay would shoot me
if he wanted to.

502
01:22:18,975 --> 01:22:21,975
But he chose Umur bey.

503
01:22:23,022 --> 01:22:27,382
- Do you think he wants Umur Bey?
- No, he wants me.

504
01:22:28,166 --> 01:22:34,116
He doesn't want my life.
He wants Kayı Beys to lose dignity.

505
01:22:36,117 --> 01:22:41,889
Yes, he wants the next Kayı Bey after
you to be undignified.

506
01:22:41,889 --> 01:22:45,969
And so that your father's bequest
won't happen.

507
01:22:47,615 --> 01:22:53,705
He wants Kayı Beys to be undignified
so we can't gather up.

508
01:22:54,802 --> 01:23:00,982
They want to keep Muslim Turks
under their control.

509
01:23:03,135 --> 01:23:08,455
Osman Bey, no one
can dare to do this, for sure.

510
01:23:15,665 --> 01:23:21,085
But, they seem to succeed
at the moment.

511
01:23:31,818 --> 01:23:37,678
My daughter, Allah is one
according to Islam.

512
01:23:38,927 --> 01:23:43,397
He didn't give birth, he did not
born.

513
01:23:44,391 --> 01:23:48,781
He is unique.

514
01:23:48,781 --> 01:23:53,306
He is in need of nothing.

515
01:23:53,306 --> 01:23:57,484
Contrarily, everything is in need of him.

516
01:23:57,484 --> 01:24:02,104
Allah has no time, no place.

517
01:24:02,634 --> 01:24:07,461
He is always with us.

518
01:24:07,461 --> 01:24:13,010
He knows, he sees.

519
01:24:13,010 --> 01:24:16,400
He is powerful enough to do
anything.

520
01:24:18,077 --> 01:24:28,157
He is the one who gives everybody
their lives, who arranges everything.

521
01:24:31,092 --> 01:24:39,202
My sweet daughter, Islam is accepting
the oneness of Allah, and giving in.

522
01:24:39,699 --> 01:24:47,189
All the prophets ever since Hz. Adam
are honoured with...

523
01:24:47,517 --> 01:24:50,883
Islam, the monotheism.

524
01:24:50,883 --> 01:24:56,803
Each prophet invited people to the belief
of the oneness of Allah and...

525
01:24:56,803 --> 01:25:02,592
notified people the commands and bans
they recieved from Allah.

526
01:25:03,219 --> 01:25:08,109
Allah sent Hz Muhammed (s.a.v)...

527
01:25:10,674 --> 01:25:14,884
as the last prophet...

528
01:25:14,897 --> 01:25:18,607
to complete the prophet circle.

529
01:25:19,084 --> 01:25:25,814
We Muslims accept all the prophets.

530
01:25:27,229 --> 01:25:34,999
The last prophet
is Hz. Muhammad Mustafa (s.a.v)

531
01:25:35,224 --> 01:25:43,344
Quran is the latest holy book that given
to our prophet by Allah.

532
01:25:45,035 --> 01:25:51,115
We believe in everything in it without
hesitation.

533
01:25:52,123 --> 01:25:58,915
We confirm angels, fate...

534
01:25:59,745 --> 01:26:06,335
resurrection, which is doomsday.

535
01:26:06,805 --> 01:26:09,975
Entering Islam is done by believing...

536
01:26:10,062 --> 01:26:18,785
in Allah, Hz Muhammed Mustafa (s.a.v) is
his prophet...

537
01:26:18,785 --> 01:26:25,095
and everything he brought us.

538
01:26:28,549 --> 01:26:34,819
We utter this belief with shahada.

539
01:26:37,595 --> 01:26:40,975
Now, my sweet daughter.

540
01:26:41,084 --> 01:26:49,074
We will witness your shahada and
being Muslim.

541
01:26:54,262 --> 01:26:59,012
In Allah's presence and in front of
the witness'...

542
01:26:59,383 --> 01:27:05,113
you shall confirm you chose
the right religion...

543
01:27:05,326 --> 01:27:09,276
under no influence and pressure.

544
01:27:13,462 --> 01:27:18,632
I chose Islam...

545
01:27:18,636 --> 01:27:20,976
under no pressure.

546
01:27:29,649 --> 01:27:34,119
- Do you witness, Bala?
- Yes I do.

547
01:27:37,375 --> 01:27:40,175
We witness.

548
01:27:41,791 --> 01:27:46,271
Now, we will see you becoming a Muslim...

549
01:27:46,407 --> 01:27:51,307
and saying shahada.

550
01:27:55,303 --> 01:28:00,033
Ashhadu an la ilaha illa Allah
(I bear witness that there is no god except the One Allah)

551
01:28:00,353 --> 01:28:05,183
Ashhadu an la ilaha illa Allah
(I bear witness that there is no god except the One Allah)

552
01:28:05,635 --> 01:28:10,635
Ashadu anna Muhammadan Rasool Allah.
(I bear witness that Muhammad is the messenger of Allah)

553
01:28:11,252 --> 01:28:17,442
Ashadu anna Muhammadan Rasool Allah.
(I bear witness that Muhammad is the messenger of Allah)

554
01:28:27,291 --> 01:28:29,651
It shall be blessed.

555
01:28:32,820 --> 01:28:37,826
Our holy book Quran says that when we
become Muslim...

556
01:28:37,826 --> 01:28:45,546
we get rid of all of our sins.

557
01:28:46,961 --> 01:28:53,711
and our prophet (s.a.v)
confirms this.

558
01:29:11,228 --> 01:29:15,188
Brother, here, tell me.

559
01:29:20,226 --> 01:29:26,926
I completed my duty, my Bey. Uncle Dündar is
seeing Merchant Suleiman and Melik constantly.

560
01:29:27,030 --> 01:29:29,770
He went to them today as well.

561
01:29:32,310 --> 01:29:35,730
My uncle is dealing with our
trading issues.

562
01:29:36,490 --> 01:29:39,411
He may see merchants, there's nothing
wrong with that.

563
01:29:39,411 --> 01:29:46,331
Yes, but he goes to them like they
are the only merchants in the world.

564
01:29:48,929 --> 01:29:54,189
We know we don't trust them, Osman Bey.

565
01:29:54,415 --> 01:29:59,395
Whenever we see their face, a trouble
finds us afterward.

566
01:30:12,121 --> 01:30:14,001
They raided our caravan, my Bey.

567
01:30:14,128 --> 01:30:16,858
They stole our fund.

568
01:30:16,961 --> 01:30:20,961
They tortured us, my Bey.

569
01:30:21,687 --> 01:30:24,287
You can't have justice with guilt.

570
01:30:24,373 --> 01:30:27,063
You can't kill someone just
because of your suspicions.

571
01:30:28,540 --> 01:30:30,330
Togay...

572
01:30:31,505 --> 01:30:33,685
raided the tent.

573
01:30:34,305 --> 01:30:36,555
Thanks to Cerkutay, we know that.

574
01:30:37,047 --> 01:30:42,597
A traitor from this tent let
Togay know, then.

575
01:30:43,167 --> 01:30:47,697
Obviously, Togay and Nikola work together.

576
01:30:49,862 --> 01:30:51,312
Brother.

577
01:30:52,028 --> 01:30:53,668
Do you remember that...

578
01:30:54,012 --> 01:30:58,242
we threw apples into the water before
eating them when we were young.

579
01:31:00,236 --> 01:31:03,496
So that we can get rid of the worms.

580
01:31:06,940 --> 01:31:10,810
If we don't get rid of the worms about
my uncle inside us...

581
01:31:11,741 --> 01:31:14,151
that worm will eat us out.

582
01:31:15,853 --> 01:31:16,993
Then...

583
01:31:18,295 --> 01:31:20,575
we'll throw the apples into the water.

584
01:31:21,679 --> 01:31:26,169
If the traitor is my uncle...

585
01:31:27,105 --> 01:31:29,495
if the killer of my son is my uncle...

586
01:31:29,717 --> 01:31:33,047
it's my right to cut his head off, my Bey.

587
01:31:33,197 --> 01:31:35,467
We'll learn it, brother.

588
01:31:35,718 --> 01:31:38,128
We will.

589
01:31:40,165 --> 01:31:42,835
We'll play such a trick that...

590
01:31:42,964 --> 01:31:46,484
we'll understand if my
uncle is a traitor and...

591
01:31:46,886 --> 01:31:50,886
we'll have Geyhatu's dog Togay...

592
01:31:51,634 --> 01:31:55,634
and kill him!

593
01:31:58,271 --> 01:32:00,141
But how, my Bey?

594
01:32:01,952 --> 01:32:04,072
I will tell you, brother.

595
01:32:05,017 --> 01:32:07,967
Tell my uncle and Gündüz brother...

596
01:32:08,950 --> 01:32:11,540
they should come here.

597
01:32:23,776 --> 01:32:33,336
- Do not let the black
mountains be destroyed...-

598
01:32:34,305 --> 01:32:42,995
- Do not cut down the
big tree with shade.-

599
01:32:43,934 --> 01:32:47,124
A bird comes, another bird flies.

600
01:32:49,879 --> 01:32:59,489
- Do not let the black
mountains be destroyed...-

601
01:33:02,131 --> 01:33:04,171
Togay...

602
01:33:04,516 --> 01:33:06,576
raided the tent and feast.

603
01:33:09,868 --> 01:33:12,228
Are you sure?

604
01:33:14,183 --> 01:33:16,093
Yes, uncle.

605
01:33:20,193 --> 01:33:22,373
How could Geyhatu's dogs...

606
01:33:22,659 --> 01:33:25,899
know about our...

607
01:33:26,107 --> 01:33:29,047
feast?

608
01:33:30,354 --> 01:33:32,794
We will learn it, uncle.

609
01:33:34,893 --> 01:33:37,273
We will learn it.

610
01:33:39,357 --> 01:33:41,757
He was close to us.

611
01:33:41,899 --> 01:33:45,399
Why did he just leave without killing?

612
01:33:45,802 --> 01:33:50,732
Their intention is obvious. They want
Beys to not trust us.

613
01:33:53,785 --> 01:33:56,015
Unbelievers say...

614
01:33:56,448 --> 01:34:00,918
"Osman Bey can't protect you.
Leave these lands."

615
01:34:01,790 --> 01:34:05,280
They say that the
tents who accepted our invite...

616
01:34:05,280 --> 01:34:07,490
won't come here.

617
01:34:12,358 --> 01:34:14,048
Now...

618
01:34:15,053 --> 01:34:17,903
Tell the Beys in Söğüt.

619
01:34:18,357 --> 01:34:21,957
Gündüz brother, tell Alps.

620
01:34:23,592 --> 01:34:26,472
We will protect the Beys on the road.

621
01:34:27,263 --> 01:34:30,373
We will accompany them to their tents.

622
01:34:30,600 --> 01:34:32,310
Your command, my Bey.

623
01:34:32,700 --> 01:34:36,700
When the dawn breaks, we
will pass Karacabel.

624
01:34:37,347 --> 01:34:43,087
Then we will stop a while and rest.

625
01:34:44,742 --> 01:34:49,092
We will leave Demir Bey in his tent and
we will come back, Inshallah.

626
01:34:51,273 --> 01:34:54,723
Inshallah.

627
01:34:59,285 --> 01:35:00,125
Uncle.

628
01:35:02,023 --> 01:35:04,803
Take care of the tent while we are away.

629
01:35:06,011 --> 01:35:08,231
Don't worry, nephew.

630
01:35:08,502 --> 01:35:12,752
You should bring the Beys to
their tents safe and sound.

631
01:35:13,885 --> 01:35:17,885
Don't worry, uncle.
I don't worry about it.

632
01:35:18,163 --> 01:35:22,163
However, we should be...

633
01:35:22,712 --> 01:35:25,612
careful this time.

634
01:35:27,428 --> 01:35:29,178
Yes.

635
01:35:38,571 --> 01:35:40,881
That's all I want to say.

636
01:35:42,283 --> 01:35:44,833
If you excuse us, Osman Bey.

637
01:35:45,430 --> 01:35:47,700
You can go.

638
01:35:53,268 --> 01:35:54,638
Osman Bey.

639
01:36:12,070 --> 01:36:13,420
My Bey.

640
01:36:15,930 --> 01:36:18,790
They say the things are crazy in Söğüt.

641
01:36:19,199 --> 01:36:22,229
Osman will never gain back...

642
01:36:22,259 --> 01:36:26,389
the reliance of Beys that he invited.

643
01:36:26,592 --> 01:36:30,592
You can't gain back the trust
when you break it once.

644
01:36:30,625 --> 01:36:31,735
You know.

645
01:36:32,335 --> 01:36:36,075
We know the intention.

646
01:36:43,458 --> 01:36:46,818
The last time Osman invited the Beys...

647
01:36:47,179 --> 01:36:49,449
all of them were killed.

648
01:36:49,566 --> 01:36:55,316
Now, Umur Bey got what he was
supposed to get.

649
01:36:55,616 --> 01:36:58,426
Osman showed his dignity but...

650
01:36:58,666 --> 01:37:02,976
then lost it.

651
01:37:05,816 --> 01:37:07,726
What does he want from you?

652
01:37:08,273 --> 01:37:11,708
He wants to take Beys to their tent
safe and sound...

653
01:37:11,708 --> 01:37:13,778
just to gain his reputation back.

654
01:37:14,884 --> 01:37:18,044
He will look after Beys.

655
01:37:18,460 --> 01:37:22,460
He told me to take care of the tent.

656
01:37:22,740 --> 01:37:25,920
Mashallah.

657
01:37:26,155 --> 01:37:29,905
He trusts you.

658
01:37:30,098 --> 01:37:34,538
Osman isn't a fool, Hatun.
Neither I am.

659
01:37:37,539 --> 01:37:40,609
What do you mean, Dündar Bey?

660
01:37:41,006 --> 01:37:43,776
I have to send news to Süleyman.

661
01:38:47,139 --> 01:38:51,139
You have lots of burdens, Osman Bey.

662
01:38:53,277 --> 01:38:56,647
I'm sorry that I can't do anything.

663
01:39:02,301 --> 01:39:04,441
The enemy will play a trick...

664
01:39:05,571 --> 01:39:07,771
and we will ruin it.

665
01:39:09,570 --> 01:39:11,890
They will do it again and...

666
01:39:12,674 --> 01:39:14,744
we will ruin it again.

667
01:39:16,761 --> 01:39:19,431
That's what will happen all the time.

668
01:39:25,287 --> 01:39:28,317
You convinced Beys to stay in Söğüt.

669
01:39:29,089 --> 01:39:31,869
Now you seem as
if you have found the traitor.

670
01:39:32,235 --> 01:39:35,605
We know who shot Umur Bey.

671
01:39:36,389 --> 01:39:41,819
Tomorrow, we will find who the
traitor is, Inshallah.

672
01:39:42,848 --> 01:39:45,758
Who do you suspect?

673
01:39:53,117 --> 01:39:56,807
I can't tell what I think of.

674
01:39:59,028 --> 01:40:00,838
If...

675
01:40:01,965 --> 01:40:04,535
If I'm right about my suspicions...

676
01:40:06,798 --> 01:40:09,438
I worry what will happen then.

677
01:40:12,905 --> 01:40:14,445
I'm afraid...

678
01:40:17,375 --> 01:40:20,465
of my anger.

679
01:40:23,072 --> 01:40:27,072
Is he someone close to us?
The person you suspect?

680
01:40:31,324 --> 01:40:33,474
Yes, Bala.

681
01:40:33,702 --> 01:40:35,302
Close?

682
01:40:38,108 --> 01:40:40,358
He is someone close to us.

683
01:40:50,586 --> 01:40:52,786
Alps are ready, Malhun Hatun.

684
01:40:53,293 --> 01:40:56,423
We will follow the evil Togay.

685
01:40:56,868 --> 01:41:00,368
We will kill him before
my father gets better.

686
01:41:01,523 --> 01:41:03,193
You won't come with me.

687
01:41:04,945 --> 01:41:06,725
Did I do something wrong?

688
01:41:06,998 --> 01:41:13,288
No. You'll stay here with Bahadır Bey
because I fully trust you.

689
01:41:13,533 --> 01:41:15,313
Take care of my father.

690
01:41:15,448 --> 01:41:19,338
Malhun Hatun, I've never
left you alone before.

691
01:41:19,621 --> 01:41:22,401
Togay is violent.
Don't.

692
01:41:22,449 --> 01:41:25,449
Do what I say.

693
01:41:25,505 --> 01:41:27,645
How will you find them?

694
01:41:27,817 --> 01:41:33,997
I will look everywhere!

695
01:42:27,264 --> 01:42:31,154
Everything is ready.
We are safe.

696
01:42:31,627 --> 01:42:34,457
Let's go if you are ready.

697
01:42:34,838 --> 01:42:38,538
- We're ready, Osman Bey.
- Thank you.

698
01:42:39,821 --> 01:42:41,241
Did you find...

699
01:42:42,351 --> 01:42:45,891
the traitor, Osman Bey?

700
01:42:47,069 --> 01:42:51,569
I will, Malhun Hatun.
Don't worry.

701
01:42:55,340 --> 01:42:57,680
However, I want something.

702
01:42:59,106 --> 01:43:01,946
Don't leave your father alone.

703
01:43:03,522 --> 01:43:08,282
Sure, Osman Bey but you can't
lose someone's trust twice.

704
01:45:17,830 --> 01:45:19,300
Malhun Hatun.

705
01:45:19,683 --> 01:45:21,633
Where are we going?

706
01:45:21,937 --> 01:45:25,147
I said we're going to find
my father's killer. Didn't you hear?

707
01:45:25,737 --> 01:45:29,747
Forgive me. I sacrifice
myself for you and our Bey.

708
01:45:30,027 --> 01:45:31,663
However, we don't
know the way.

709
01:45:31,663 --> 01:45:34,123
We don't even know whom we are following.

710
01:45:34,253 --> 01:45:36,073
You're right.

711
01:45:36,952 --> 01:45:40,112
However, the enemies know us well.

712
01:45:40,206 --> 01:45:45,036
My father's killers want to destroy the
dignity of Osman Bey and...

713
01:45:45,126 --> 01:45:48,456
they want to harm our union.

714
01:45:49,247 --> 01:45:51,867
They know that I follow my father's way.

715
01:45:51,971 --> 01:45:55,331
They know that we will build
a tent with Osman Bey.

716
01:45:55,526 --> 01:45:59,476
They want me now.
They will follow me.

717
01:45:59,909 --> 01:46:02,579
You sacrifice yourself for your father.

718
01:46:03,012 --> 01:46:07,362
Not just for my father, also for our tent.

719
01:46:08,868 --> 01:46:11,808
Get ready now.
It's time for revenge.

720
01:47:25,386 --> 01:47:27,196
She is coming.

721
01:47:29,822 --> 01:47:33,822
The forest road is bleeding.

722
01:48:20,358 --> 01:48:22,448
Alps are on their way.

723
01:48:22,914 --> 01:48:25,544
Two hunters are following them.

724
01:48:39,620 --> 01:48:41,120
Dündar.

725
01:48:41,309 --> 01:48:43,829
He is the cruelest traitor I know.

726
01:48:45,293 --> 01:48:49,293
I love traitors who serve me.

727
01:48:50,740 --> 01:48:52,370
Let's go.

728
01:48:52,933 --> 01:48:54,563
Come on!

729
01:48:55,671 --> 01:48:59,331
Kayı forests will be full of blood.

730
01:49:27,049 --> 01:49:28,449
Stop.

731
01:49:39,901 --> 01:49:41,691
Alps!

732
01:49:42,754 --> 01:49:45,094
We will wait here.

733
01:49:46,160 --> 01:49:48,790
- Boran.
- Yes, my Bey.

734
01:49:49,306 --> 01:49:51,166
Protect the Beys.

735
01:49:51,375 --> 01:49:54,895
- They won't get any harm.
- Your command, my Bey.

736
01:50:54,408 --> 01:50:56,878
If the traitor...

737
01:50:57,614 --> 01:50:59,464
is my uncle...

738
01:51:01,050 --> 01:51:04,540
Togay will know that we
will locate here with the Beys.

739
01:51:21,828 --> 01:51:24,568
He may attack at any time.

740
01:51:27,318 --> 01:51:29,618
A Bey of Kayı...

741
01:51:30,484 --> 01:51:33,064
the son of Suleyman Shah...

742
01:51:33,496 --> 01:51:35,196
our uncle...

743
01:51:36,475 --> 01:51:38,755
how could he do it?

744
01:51:39,822 --> 01:51:42,542
Does it make sense?

745
01:51:44,235 --> 01:51:46,565
If he isn't the traitor...

746
01:51:46,973 --> 01:51:50,973
neither it is me nor you...

747
01:51:51,583 --> 01:51:53,263
now my brother...

748
01:51:54,678 --> 01:51:56,288
and Bamsı Bey.

749
01:51:57,391 --> 01:52:02,771
If my uncle is the traitor, it means
he is the killer of my son Bayhoca.

750
01:52:03,050 --> 01:52:04,800
We should punish him.

751
01:52:04,866 --> 01:52:07,916
What his punishment is clear.

752
01:52:08,716 --> 01:52:11,136
It is.

753
01:52:15,005 --> 01:52:18,205
When you tried to kill him...

754
01:52:18,428 --> 01:52:19,958
I was mad at you.

755
01:52:23,228 --> 01:52:27,208
I thought you were going too far
as you had no evidence.

756
01:52:27,377 --> 01:52:28,817
However...

757
01:52:29,937 --> 01:52:34,437
if the traitor is my
uncle, I will kill him.

758
01:52:34,707 --> 01:52:37,327
We don't know yet, brother.

759
01:52:37,433 --> 01:52:39,563
We don't.

760
01:52:39,774 --> 01:52:43,774
When the enemy comes, we'll know.

761
01:52:46,430 --> 01:52:49,050
I think they will come.

762
01:52:49,474 --> 01:52:52,034
I will kill them first...

763
01:52:52,034 --> 01:52:55,844
then my uncle.

764
01:52:57,279 --> 01:52:59,719
We will get it.

765
01:53:01,294 --> 01:53:03,544
We will.

766
01:53:30,582 --> 01:53:32,152
Trap!

767
01:53:32,324 --> 01:53:34,184
Protect Malhun Hatun!

768
01:54:16,515 --> 01:54:17,985
Where is Togay?

769
01:54:24,072 --> 01:54:25,812
Where is Togay?

770
01:54:26,912 --> 01:54:29,662
He is close as death.

771
01:55:04,045 --> 01:55:04,935
Stop.

772
01:55:13,708 --> 01:55:15,408
Evil!

773
01:55:17,663 --> 01:55:20,263
Revenge is blinding.

774
01:55:24,126 --> 01:55:27,136
It blinds beautiful eyes.

775
01:55:31,387 --> 01:55:33,277
I knew you'd follow me.

776
01:55:44,024 --> 01:55:47,134
Why doesn't Osman want...

777
01:55:47,349 --> 01:55:50,089
me to follow him, Petrus?

778
01:55:55,907 --> 01:55:57,697
Dündar Bey.

779
01:55:58,620 --> 01:56:02,620
Osman knows that after
he falls from grace...

780
01:56:03,377 --> 01:56:07,697
you will want to kill him, Togay.

781
01:56:11,056 --> 01:56:15,316
Dündar thinks that Osman
fools him to catch you.

782
01:56:17,546 --> 01:56:20,036
Osman will entrap me.

783
01:56:20,141 --> 01:56:24,141
He will fool Dündar and he will expose me.

784
01:56:24,441 --> 01:56:26,611
Wow.

785
01:56:27,562 --> 01:56:31,562
His uncle is as shrewd as Osman.

786
01:56:32,295 --> 01:56:34,265
We need Dündar.

787
01:56:34,620 --> 01:56:38,360
We shouldn't expose him.

788
01:56:38,540 --> 01:56:42,140
I destroyed the relationship between
Osman and Umur Bey.

789
01:56:42,705 --> 01:56:44,375
Now it's time for her daughter.

790
01:56:45,352 --> 01:56:46,802
Malhun Hatun.

791
01:56:48,406 --> 01:56:50,586
Göktuğ saw me.

792
01:56:50,669 --> 01:56:54,489
Cerkutay will understand that I did
the assassination.

793
01:56:54,695 --> 01:56:59,515
Malhun will be angry at me.

794
01:56:59,907 --> 01:57:03,117
She will
follow me to take revenge.

795
01:57:03,263 --> 01:57:06,353
- Without knowing your place?
- She will know.

796
01:57:06,956 --> 01:57:11,116
While Osman is waiting in the place
that he will entrap me at...

797
01:57:12,124 --> 01:57:14,994
I will fight Malhun Hatun.

798
01:57:15,353 --> 01:57:19,683
First, her father and then his daughter.

799
01:57:19,758 --> 01:57:23,188
Kızılbeyoğulları and Kayıs...

800
01:57:23,878 --> 01:57:27,168
will never be together.

801
01:57:34,029 --> 01:57:37,439
I smell blood to my lungs.

802
01:57:41,366 --> 01:57:44,516
I'll cut your lungs off and
make you eat them, Togay!

803
01:57:45,870 --> 01:57:49,500
A filly should have a saddle.

804
02:00:12,998 --> 02:00:15,918
I'll let you live, woman.

805
02:00:17,005 --> 02:00:19,245
Tell Osman that...

806
02:00:19,449 --> 02:00:23,449
Geyhatu knows what he is doing.

807
02:00:23,531 --> 02:00:27,921
I will kill all of the people
in the tents...

808
02:00:28,221 --> 02:00:31,111
who come for Osman's invite.

809
02:00:34,316 --> 02:00:36,666
Kill me, Togay.

810
02:00:39,122 --> 02:00:43,722
I will kill you if you don't kill me.

811
02:01:01,778 --> 02:01:03,558
Let's go.

812
02:02:15,242 --> 02:02:17,542
They may attack at any time.

813
02:02:24,442 --> 02:02:26,412
We're here for their dead bodies...

814
02:02:27,367 --> 02:02:29,547
but the soil we're on has got wormy.

815
02:02:32,304 --> 02:02:34,354
What does that mean, Cerkutay?

816
02:02:34,455 --> 02:02:37,275
You become angry quickly.

817
02:02:39,151 --> 02:02:42,041
We aren't facing off against
Byzantine's fancy dogs.

818
02:02:42,369 --> 02:02:45,019
We are facing off against Togay.

819
02:02:49,729 --> 02:02:53,169
Don't you think Togay took the bait?

820
02:02:54,250 --> 02:02:56,180
Cerkutay doesn't know.

821
02:02:57,354 --> 02:03:00,954
Togay's voice stops the wind.

822
02:03:01,814 --> 02:03:05,124
Togay's breath burns the forests.

823
02:03:07,720 --> 02:03:10,180
Osman Bey knows what he is doing.

824
02:03:11,511 --> 02:03:13,361
Black Shaman Togay.

825
02:03:14,562 --> 02:03:16,632
He does his job with black spirits.

826
02:03:38,451 --> 02:03:40,951
I think my uncle hasn't sent news.

827
02:03:43,590 --> 02:03:45,160
I wonder if...

828
02:03:46,717 --> 02:03:49,077
our suspicions are in vain.

829
02:03:50,345 --> 02:03:53,345
Looks like they are, Osman Bey.

830
02:04:00,329 --> 02:04:03,009
I have to send news to Süleyman.

831
02:04:03,189 --> 02:04:06,989
You can't leave the tent as
you may attract attention.

832
02:04:11,187 --> 02:04:15,187
You will send the news, not me.

833
02:04:31,281 --> 02:04:34,051
I don't feel sorry as
we're here for no reason.

834
02:04:34,404 --> 02:04:37,764
I feel happy
because our uncle isn't a traitor.

835
02:04:59,791 --> 02:05:03,681
- My Alps will accompany you to your tents.
- Thank you, Osman Bey

836
02:05:05,059 --> 02:05:06,999
Thank you.

837
02:05:07,551 --> 02:05:09,121
Alps!

838
02:05:09,611 --> 02:05:11,651
We're going back.

839
02:05:12,283 --> 02:05:13,743
Come on.

840
02:06:14,168 --> 02:06:15,238
Stop!

841
02:06:18,420 --> 02:06:19,740
Malhun Hatun!

842
02:06:24,628 --> 02:06:25,758
Malhun Hatun!

843
02:06:26,018 --> 02:06:29,518
Malhun Hatun! Malhun Hatun!

844
02:06:34,521 --> 02:06:36,241
Lie down.

845
02:06:36,522 --> 02:06:39,222
Lie down.

846
02:06:42,087 --> 02:06:44,087
Are you fine?

847
02:06:45,906 --> 02:06:49,576
Malhun Hatun! Malhun Hatun!

848
02:06:50,515 --> 02:06:53,295
She is alive.
She is alive.

849
02:06:53,863 --> 02:06:57,033
Get ready Alps!

850
02:07:01,128 --> 02:07:04,638
- Malhun Hatun.
- What happened? Tell me.

851
02:07:05,282 --> 02:07:06,732
Who did this?

852
02:07:08,945 --> 02:07:12,945
Togay killed my Alps.

853
02:07:15,133 --> 02:07:17,503
All of them.

854
02:07:18,571 --> 02:07:20,071
Togay?

855
02:07:24,801 --> 02:07:27,451
My uncle isn't a traitor, Osman Bey.

856
02:07:30,128 --> 02:07:31,478
My uncle isn't a traitor.

857
02:07:31,691 --> 02:07:34,811
Togay followed Malhun Hatun.

858
02:07:36,316 --> 02:07:37,606
- Saltuk.
- My Bey.

859
02:07:37,719 --> 02:07:39,239
Tell Cerkutay.

860
02:07:39,949 --> 02:07:42,949
- He should find the trace of Togay.
- Your command, my Bey.

861
02:07:53,705 --> 02:07:57,925
Hold on.

862
02:07:59,200 --> 02:08:01,360
Malhun Hatun.

863
02:08:07,194 --> 02:08:09,664
Hold on.
Malhun Hatun.

864
02:08:11,087 --> 02:08:12,577
You will live.

865
02:08:16,808 --> 02:08:19,508
Bala! Help her. She
lost lots of blood.

866
02:08:24,731 --> 02:08:27,821
Come on, Bala!
Help her.

867
02:08:34,368 --> 02:08:35,998
Malhun Hatun.

868
02:08:37,825 --> 02:08:40,245
Come on, my Bala.

869
02:08:40,831 --> 02:08:42,881
Open your eyes.

870
02:08:43,775 --> 02:08:46,035
Open your eyes.

871
02:08:49,570 --> 02:08:53,690
- Osman Bey.
- Yes. Tell me.

872
02:09:04,229 --> 02:09:07,189
Why didn't Togay kill you?

873
02:09:08,009 --> 02:09:11,269
Togay...

874
02:09:12,616 --> 02:09:16,616
wanted me to tell you...

875
02:09:22,840 --> 02:09:24,800
What will you say?

876
02:09:27,423 --> 02:09:29,453
Geyhatu...

877
02:09:30,257 --> 02:09:32,767
knows what you're doing.

878
02:09:39,843 --> 02:09:42,893
He said...

879
02:09:43,343 --> 02:09:47,343
He will kill all of the people
in the tents...

880
02:09:51,434 --> 02:09:54,904
who came for Osman's invite.

881
02:10:04,677 --> 02:10:25,627
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com